# Review owners. @OWNER is a placeholder: replace it with the maintainer's
# account or team when the repository is published, before enabling "Require
# review from Code Owners".
*                            @OWNER

# Changes to CI, its pinned keys and the hygiene rules get an explicit owner
# review even when the rule above is narrowed later.
/.github/                    @OWNER
/ci/                         @OWNER
/tests/public-hygiene.*      @OWNER
/tests/no-hardcoded-config.* @OWNER
/config/versions.env         @OWNER
